## 思路

**二分**:每次取中点后,先判断哪半边是有序的(`nums[l] <= nums[m]` 则左半有序),再判断 target 是否落在有序半边,据此收缩到另一半。O(log n)。

## 参考代码

```js
function search(nums, target) {
  let l = 0;
  let r = nums.length - 1;
  while (l <= r) {
    const m = (l + r) >> 1;
    if (nums[m] === target) return m;
    if (nums[l] <= nums[m]) {
      if (nums[l] <= target && target < nums[m]) r = m - 1;
      else l = m + 1;
    } else {
      if (nums[m] < target && target <= nums[r]) l = m + 1;
      else r = m - 1;
    }
  }
  return -1;
}
```

## 复杂度

- 时间:O(log n)
- 空间:O(1)
